<p>Akbar.. haye akbar, haye akbar..(2)</p>

<p>Haaye,<br />
ghode se girke jab ali akbar ne di sadaa<br />
apni kamar ko thaam ke shabbir ne kaha<br />
kadiyal jawa'n ki laash uthane chale hai hum<br />
are seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>kadiyal jawa'n ki laash uthane chale hai hum<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>1. Ye imteha'n za'eefi mein mujhko nibhana hai<br />
akbar ko leke khaima e zainab mein jaana hai<br />
raste mein ladkhadaye na shabbir ke qadam<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>2. Ghurbat pe apni roya hai khud ibn e fatima<br />
gir gir ke tay kiya hai ye maqtal ka faasla<br />
bus hum se door laash hai akbar ki do qadam<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>3. Laasha hai is qadar ke larazte hai mere haath<br />
laasha hai ye rasool ka, akbar ke saath saath<br />
do laashe ek saath uthaenge kaise hum<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>4. Is haal mein mujhe kahi'n Zahra na dekh le<br />
haye meri kamar jhuki hui, baba na dekh le<br />
aate hi honge meri madad ko shahe umamm<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>5. Seene mein kehke todi hai zalim ne ye sina<br />
ab dekhna hussain ki niklegi kaise jaa'n<br />
zalim ko ye batana hai ibn e ali hai hum<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>6. Is haal mein khayam mein jaunga kis tarha<br />
Zainab ki kayenaat uthaunga kis tarha<br />
Zahra ka chand karbobala mein hua hai kham<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>7. Amma ke saath milke sina maine khaich li<br />
haatho mein ab hamare wo taaqat nahi rahi<br />
Abbas kya gaye mere bazu hue qalam<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>8. Baahein gale mein daal di akbar ne jis ghadi<br />
ibn e ali ne roke takallum sadaa ye di<br />
saanse bachi hai ab mere akbar ke paas kam<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>

<p>kadiyal jawa'n ki laash uthane chale hai hum<br />
seedhi ho aye kamar, tujhe abbas ki qasam</p>